# Original Marble Recovery level (2026-10-04). Not derived from any Marble Madness course.
# Teaches: low gravity. Falls are long and soft, so leap off each edge and steer in
# the air across the gaps. Too fast and you sail past the next platform.
name: Weightless
time: 70
theme: madness
gravity: 6
story: Here, falling takes its time.
story: Physics that should not work, does. Jump the gaps. Try not to enjoy it too much.
route: 2,2 7,2 12,2 17,2 22,2
